Z||000000||hugh||09-16-2000||01:23 PM||||It seems to me there are many forum members that have 1/4 mile experience.What are your best times?and in what?I have gone 12.20@ 115mph in my family car,a 1987 Grand National(no traction-60 foot time of 1.95 sec.)and 10.13@131mph in my Buick v6 dragster(broken engine)I am sure there members that have gone quite a bit faster.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hugh_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
