Z||000007||Cooter||09-18-2000||08:05 PM||||15.5@88 mph in a totally stock 305 powered Camaro. The bad thing was- I was not the slowest thing at the track that day! I "think" my Fiero with the 3.4 would be faster. Looking back, I think my 3/4 ton Suburban would be faster!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||HugGRRRFiero||09-18-2000||08:22 PM||||  Actually I didn't go that quick for real.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I made the pass on a computer game called Burnout Drag Racing.  A newer version called IHRA is due out around just before the holiday season.  It's a pretty realistic drag racing simulation and the best part is you can race against other people with the game online.  You can setup your car's engine right down to the cam angles, suspension, and even paint your own cars.  Pro street, muscle cars, top fuel, funny, and pro stocks included.  I took a corvette and made it look like a Fiero!  If your interested Huge or anyone I can post a link to a web page I made for the game.||||reg||12
